Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: qishiyi <qishiyi77@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), iproute2, iputils-ping, systemd
Description: LAN MAC Finder for TOS 7
 Discover routed physical IPv4 networks and match devices by
 the last four hexadecimal characters of their MAC address.
